WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:04.587
- Look at this.
- "Top Idol Match"?

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:08.550
It sounds like a variety program.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:11.386
It was actually a plan for a TV show,

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:14.889
but if I can do it with you,
that'd be great.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:18.143
In front of everyone, after the concert.

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:22.731
- I hope I don't get in the way.
- Of course you won't.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:26.651
This concert is our chance
to pick a new member.

00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:29.988
The bet is 50 million yen.

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:33.450
That's enough to get you out
of being a house pet, right?

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.826
- Yes.
- And...

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:39.497
if I win, of course,
your debt amount will increase.

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:44.210
And if that happens...
you'll form an idol unit with me.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:50.175
I'll have your life plan changed
to reflect that.

00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:54.679
I've even got a unit name.
It's "Dreaming Creaming Sisters"!

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:57.182
What?

00:00:57.265 --> 00:01:00.643
We both have "yume,"
or "dream" in our names.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:02.437
Don't you think that's fate?

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.274
But being an idol isn't always fun.

00:01:06.357 --> 00:01:10.236
Lessons are hard,
and you don't have a private life.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.031
And of course,
romance is out of the question.

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:16.951
You'll have to adjust
your whole life around being an idol.

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:18.495
I see.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:21.623
But why are you so willing to be an idol?

00:01:21.664 --> 00:01:24.542
Of course, for the smiles of my fans.

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:27.295
Don't lie to me.

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:31.132
You hate your fans, right?

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:36.387
What are you saying? That's impossible.

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:38.139
Oh, you're sure?

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.809
Then what is this?

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:48.108
Maybe I'll read a little!

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:54.405
"To my beloved Yumemi. Thanks for your
fun concerts! You always do a great job!

00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:57.826
Lately, you've been so popular
on YourTube,

00:01:57.867 --> 00:02:00.370
I'm very proud to head your fan club.

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:06.000
But as a long-time fan, I'm a little sad.

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:11.673
Lately, I've been busy studying,
but when I see how hard you're working..."

00:02:11.714 --> 00:02:12.841
Enough!

00:02:13.383 --> 00:02:14.217
Yumemi...

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:16.845
You're right.

00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:18.596
So, what?

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:22.517
If you're continuing being an idol
even though you hate your fans,

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:25.311
you must have some kind of strong goal.

00:02:26.688 --> 00:02:29.941
If I don't know what that is, then I...

